      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افطأ</span></b>  <i>He copulated much,</i> or <i>often.</i> (IAar,
O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>He became ample in his state,</i> or
<i>circumstances.</i> (IAar, O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>His nature,</i>
or <i>disposition, became evil, after having been good.</i>
(IAar, O, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افطأهُ</span> <i>He fed him; gave him to
eat;</i> or <i>gave him food.</i> (O, K.)

